#: ../../source/reference/liteframe/generated/maxframe.liteframe.LiteFrame.dt.round.rst:2
msgid "maxframe.liteframe.LiteFrame.dt.round"
msgstr ""

#: of pandas.core.arrays.datetimelike.TimelikeOps.round:1
msgid "Perform round operation on the data to the specified `freq`."
msgstr "对数据执行舍入操作到指定的 `freq`。"

#: of pandas.core.arrays.datetimelike.TimelikeOps.round
msgid "参数"
msgstr ""

#: of pandas.core.arrays.datetimelike.TimelikeOps.round:3
msgid ""
"The frequency level to round the index to. Must be a fixed frequency like"
" 's' (second) not 'ME' (month end). See :ref:`frequency aliases "
"<timeseries.offset_aliases>` for a list of possible `freq` values."
msgstr ""
"将索引舍入到的频率级别。必须是固定的频率，如 's'（秒），而不是 'ME'（月末）。有关可能的 `freq` 值列表，请参阅 :ref:`频率别名 "
"<timeseries.offset_aliases>`。"

#: of pandas.core.arrays.datetimelike.TimelikeOps.round:8
msgid ""
"Only relevant for DatetimeIndex:  - 'infer' will attempt to infer fall "
"dst-transition hours based on   order - bool-ndarray where True signifies"
" a DST time, False designates   a non-DST time (note that this flag is "
"only applicable for   ambiguous times) - 'NaT' will return NaT where "
"there are ambiguous times - 'raise' will raise a ValueError if there are "
"ambiguous   times."
msgstr ""
"仅适用于 DatetimeIndex：- 'infer' 将根据顺序尝试推断秋季夏令时转换时间 - bool-ndarray 其中 True 表示夏令时，False 表示非夏令时"
"（注意此标志仅适用于模糊时间）- 'NaT' 在存在模糊时间时返回 NaT - 'raise' 在存在模糊时间时引发 ValueError。"

#: of pandas.core.arrays.datetimelike.TimelikeOps.round:8
msgid "Only relevant for DatetimeIndex:"
msgstr "仅对 DatetimeIndex 有效："

#: of pandas.core.arrays.datetimelike.TimelikeOps.round:10
msgid "'infer' will attempt to infer fall dst-transition hours based on order"
msgstr "'infer' 将根据顺序尝试推断秋季夏令时转换时间"

#: of pandas.core.arrays.datetimelike.TimelikeOps.round:12
msgid ""
"bool-ndarray where True signifies a DST time, False designates a non-DST "
"time (note that this flag is only applicable for ambiguous times)"
msgstr ""
"bool-ndarray 其中 True 表示夏令时，False 表示非夏令时（注意此标志仅适用于"
"模糊时间）"

#: of pandas.core.arrays.datetimelike.TimelikeOps.round:15
msgid "'NaT' will return NaT where there are ambiguous times"
msgstr "'NaT' 在存在模糊时间时返回 NaT"

#: of pandas.core.arrays.datetimelike.TimelikeOps.round:16
msgid "'raise' will raise a ValueError if there are ambiguous times."
msgstr "'raise' 在存在模糊时间时会引发 ValueError。"

#: of pandas.core.arrays.datetimelike.TimelikeOps.round:19
msgid ""
"A nonexistent time does not exist in a particular timezone where clocks "
"moved forward due to DST.  - 'shift_forward' will shift the nonexistent "
"time forward to the   closest existing time - 'shift_backward' will shift"
" the nonexistent time backward to the   closest existing time - 'NaT' "
"will return NaT where there are nonexistent times - timedelta objects "
"will shift nonexistent times by the timedelta - 'raise' will raise a "
"ValueError if there are   nonexistent times."
msgstr ""
"不存在的时间是指在由于夏令时导致时钟向前移动的特定时区中不存在的时间。- 'shift_forward' 将不存在的时间向前移动到最近的存在的"
"时间 - 'shift_backward' 将不存在的时间向后移动到最近的存在的时间 - 'NaT' 在存在不存在的时间时返回 NaT - "
"timedelta 对象将通过 timedelta 移动不存在的时间 - 'raise' 在存在不存在的时间时引发 ValueError。"

#: of pandas.core.arrays.datetimelike.TimelikeOps.round:19
msgid ""
"A nonexistent time does not exist in a particular timezone where clocks "
"moved forward due to DST."
msgstr "不存在的时间是指在特定时区中由于夏令时导致时钟向前移动而不存在的时间。"

#: of pandas.core.arrays.datetimelike.TimelikeOps.round:22
msgid ""
"'shift_forward' will shift the nonexistent time forward to the closest "
"existing time"
msgstr "'shift_forward' 将不存在的时间向前移动到最近的存在的时间"

#: of pandas.core.arrays.datetimelike.TimelikeOps.round:24
msgid ""
"'shift_backward' will shift the nonexistent time backward to the closest "
"existing time"
msgstr "'shift_backward' 将不存在的时间向后移动到最近的存在的时间"

#: of pandas.core.arrays.datetimelike.TimelikeOps.round:26
msgid "'NaT' will return NaT where there are nonexistent times"
msgstr "'NaT' 在存在不存在的时间时返回 NaT"

#: of pandas.core.arrays.datetimelike.TimelikeOps.round:27
msgid "timedelta objects will shift nonexistent times by the timedelta"
msgstr "timedelta 对象将通过 timedelta 移动不存在的时间"

#: of pandas.core.arrays.datetimelike.TimelikeOps.round:28
msgid "'raise' will raise a ValueError if there are nonexistent times."
msgstr "'raise' 在存在不存在的时间时会引发 ValueError。"

#: of pandas.core.arrays.datetimelike.TimelikeOps.round
msgid "返回"
msgstr ""

#: of pandas.core.arrays.datetimelike.TimelikeOps.round:32
msgid ""
"Index of the same type for a DatetimeIndex or TimedeltaIndex, or a Series"
" with the same index for a LiteFrame."
msgstr ""
"对于 DatetimeIndex 或 TimedeltaIndex 为相同类型的索引，或对于 LiteFrame "
"为具有相同索引的 Series。"

#: of pandas.core.arrays.datetimelike.TimelikeOps.round
msgid "返回类型"
msgstr ""

#: of pandas.core.arrays.datetimelike.TimelikeOps.round
msgid "抛出"
msgstr ""

#: of pandas.core.arrays.datetimelike.TimelikeOps.round:40
msgid ":py:obj:`DatetimeIndex.floor`"
msgstr ""

#: of pandas.core.arrays.datetimelike.TimelikeOps.round:41
msgid "Perform floor operation on the data to the specified `freq`."
msgstr "对数据执行向下取整操作到指定的 `freq`。"

#: of pandas.core.arrays.datetimelike.TimelikeOps.round:43
msgid ":py:obj:`DatetimeIndex.snap`"
msgstr ""

#: of pandas.core.arrays.datetimelike.TimelikeOps.round:44
msgid "Snap time stamps to nearest occurring frequency."
msgstr "将时间戳对齐到最近出现的频率。"

#: of pandas.core.arrays.datetimelike.TimelikeOps.round:47
msgid "备注"
msgstr ""

#: of pandas.core.arrays.datetimelike.TimelikeOps.round:48
msgid ""
"If the timestamps have a timezone, rounding will take place relative to "
"the local (\"wall\") time and re-localized to the same timezone. When "
"rounding near daylight savings time, use ``nonexistent`` and "
"``ambiguous`` to control the re-localization behavior."
msgstr ""
"如果时间戳有时区，舍入将相对于本地（\"墙\"）时间进行，并重新定位到同一时"
"区。在接近夏令时进行舍入时，使用 ``nonexistent`` 和 ``ambiguous`` 来控制"
"重新定位行为。"

